 "transcript": "Your call is booked. In the next few minutes, you're going to see exactly what happens on the call and what you walk away with so you can show up and get the most out of your time with your advisor. On that call, you get somebody that took me years of driving bank to bank to build. Your funding advisor pulls your credit file with you on a Google Meet. Your funding advisor pulls your credit file with you on a live Google Meet. It's a three-bureau soft pull that costs $32 which covers what the bureaus charge for, which covers what the bureaus charge for the reports, and it has zero impact on your score. And there's a big reason we pull all three bureaus instead of just one. Then we analyze your file with underwrite IQ, the AI machine learning software we built to underwrite the files the same way lenders do, and we go through your file together. You'll see exactly how much we think you'll qualify for based on where you're at right now, what's holding your file back if anything, and the fastest way to get into your, the fastest way to get your file to the maximum amount of funding. Different banks pull different bureaus. So your information has to match all three. Your information has to match on all three. When it doesn't match, about one in three banks approve you. And when it matches two out of three and sometimes three out of three. Three out of three banks will approve you. That's why we check all three before you apply anywhere. Most of the people we work with are aiming for somewhere between $250,000 and $400,000 in funding. Some files are ready for that today, and a lot of them aren't there yet, which is completely normal. Wherever your file is right now, we have a path for that phase. If your file is ready, we go get the capital in funding rounds. Keep your credit clean between each round. If something is holding it back, be optimized your credit first and then fund you. And if you'd rather do the work on your file yourself, we'll walk you through every step with a detailed accountability system and dashboard, a detailed accountability system, a detailed accountability system and dashboard. On the call, your advisor walks you through the options. and pricing for your path and everything is in writing. So you could see some of the approvals on our, you could see some of the approvals our clients have gotten right here on this page. The part that took me years is knowing exactly what every bank looks for. I used to drive to every single bank in my state to learn it myself and over the last decade, we've worked with hundreds of files and collected thousands of data points on what lenders approve and all of that is built into under IQ. So in one call your advisor can tell you what's most likely to occur on your file. Your advisor is holding that time just for you. So right after this video, open the confirmation email and accept the calendar invite to lock in on your calendar, to lock it in on your calendar. Your advisor shares their screen with you on the call. So take it from a computer somewhere quiet. If you're going after business funding, have your business basics ready. your entity name, how long you've been in business, and your average monthly revenue. And if something comes up, use the reschedule link on this page to pick a new time so you can keep your spot open, so you keep your spot with your advisor. Thank you for booking and I'll see you on the call.",
